Require:
  - :negative-preconditions
Predicate:
  + (NOT-chosen simple) neg-of (chosen)
  - (chosen simple)
  + (chosen simple) neg-of (NOT-chosen)
Action:
  - choose: ?x - simple ?l1 - level ?l2 - level
      pre: (and (next ?l1 ?l2) (not (chosen ?x)) (num-subs ?l2) (possible ?x))
      eff: (and (chosen ?x) (not (num-subs ?l2)) (num-subs ?l1))
  + choose: ?x - simple ?l1 - level ?l2 - level
      pre: (and (NOT-chosen ?x) (next ?l1 ?l2) (num-subs ?l2) (possible ?x))
      eff: (and (chosen ?x) (not (NOT-chosen ?x)) (not (num-subs ?l2)) (num-subs ?l1))
Init:
  + (NOT-chosen ap2)
  + (NOT-chosen cdc25c)
  + (NOT-chosen cdk46p3-cycd)
  + (NOT-chosen cdk46p3-cycdp1)
  + (NOT-chosen cdk7)
  + (NOT-chosen chk1)
  + (NOT-chosen dmp1)
  + (NOT-chosen e2f13)
  + (NOT-chosen p130-e2f5p1-dp12)
  + (NOT-chosen p16)
  + (NOT-chosen p300)
  + (NOT-chosen pcaf)
  + (NOT-chosen prb-e2f4p1-dp12)
  + (NOT-chosen prbp2)
  + (NOT-chosen raf1)
  + (NOT-chosen sp1)
Pred prop:
  + (NOT-chosen simple): in_init in_pre in_eff
  - (chosen simple): in_pre in_pre_neg in_eff
  + (chosen simple): in_pre in_eff
Global prop:
  - has_non_static_neg_cond
